The FOREMAN is BRAKED.

While this file exists on journal2, the garden's foreman pump is
silenced: it promotes no deferred plan jobs and generates no new
milestone steps. This is the FOREMAN-ONLY brake — it does NOT drain
the fleet. Gardeners keep claiming and running jobs normally; only
the autonomous pump that generates new work is paused.

The fleet drain (scripts/jobs/drain-fleet.sh) still stops the foreman
too, so a drained fleet needs no brake. Use this brake when you want
the fleet working but the pump quiet.

To let the foreman resume pumping, clear this brake:
    scripts/jobs/brake-foreman.sh off

